ch has been done is that which shall be done; and there is no new thing under the sun."},{"verse":10,"text":"Is there a thing of which it may be said, “Behold, this is new”? It has been long ago, in the ages which were before us."},{"verse":11,"text":"There is no memory of the former; neither shall there be any memory of the latter that are to come, among those that shall come after."},{"verse":12,"text":"I, the Preacher, was king over Israel in Jerusalem."},{"verse":13,"text":"I applied my heart to seek and to search out by wisdom concerning all that is done under the sky. It is a heavy burden that God has given to the sons of men to be afflicted with."},{"verse":14,"text":"I have seen all the works that are done under the sun; and behold, all is vanity and a chasing after wind."},{"verse":15,"text":"That which is crooked can’t be made straight; and that which is lacking can’t be counted."},{"verse":16,"text":"I said to myself, “Behold, I have obtained for myself great wisdom above all who were before me in Jerusalem. Yes, my heart has had great experience of wisdom and knowledge.”"},{"verse":17,"text":"I applied my heart to know wisdom, and to know madness and folly. I perceived that this also was a chasing after wind."},{"verse":18,"text":"For in much wisdom is much grief; and he who increases knowledge increases sorrow."}],"hasArtwork":false,"availableLangs":[]}]